---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import J from '../../components/J.astro';
export { paths as getStaticPaths } from '../../data/paths';
import { projects } from '../../data/projects';
const { lang } = Astro.params; const ja = lang==='ja';
const _b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const B = _b.endsWith('/') ? _b.slice(0, -1) : _b;
---
<Base lang={lang} page="about" title={ja?'自己紹介':'About'}>
{ja ? <>
<h1>自己紹介</h1><p class="en">About me</p>
<J en="Nice to meet you. My name is Prithivi Raj Mohanta. I am an AI engineer in India.">はじめまして。プリティヴィ・ラージ・モハンタと申します。インドのAIエンジニアです。</J>
<J en="I build systems that check whether AI works correctly.">AIが正しく動いているかを<ruby>確<rt>たし</rt></ruby>かめる仕組みを作っています。</J>
<J en="I want to work on improving AI quality with a team in Japan.">日本のチームで、AIの品質を上げる仕事がしたいです。</J>
<h2>技術スキル</h2><p class="en">Technical skills</p>
<ul>
<li><J tag="span" en="LLM evaluation and safety tests">LLMの評価と安全性テスト</J></li>
<li><J tag="span" en="Search and RAG for Japanese text (bge-m3, BM25)">日本語の検索とRAG（bge-m3、BM25）</J></li>
<li><J tag="span" en="Python, machine learning, automatic tests (CI)">Python、機械学習、自動テスト（CI）</J></li>
</ul>
<h2>言語</h2><p class="en">Languages</p>
<J en="English: I use it every day at work. Japanese: taking JLPT N2 on December 6, 2026. I also speak Hindi, Bengali and Odia.">英語：毎日仕事で使っています。日本語：2026年12月6日にJLPT N2を受験します。ヒンディー語、ベンガル語、オディア語も話します。</J>
</> : <>
<h1>About</h1>
<p>I'm Prithivi Raj Mohanta, an AI engineer in India. I build systems that check whether AI works correctly, and I want to do that with a team in Japan.</p>
<h2>Technical skills</h2>
<ul><li>LLM evaluation and safety testing</li><li>Search and RAG for Japanese text (bge-m3, BM25)</li><li>Python, machine learning, automated tests (CI)</li></ul>
<h2>Languages</h2>
<p>English for daily work. Japanese: taking JLPT N2 on Dec 6, 2026. I also speak Hindi, Bengali and Odia.</p>
</>}
</Base>
